From: A Contributor <contributor@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Try it in a folder of its own, and say how long the image
 takes to build

Signed-off-by: A Contributor <contributor@example.invalid>
---
 README.md | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index c398afe..df4efa8 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -85,10 +85,10 @@ The Screen Compiler's dev container and its contract check come from NoWayOS, so
 the two side by side:
 
 ```sh
-mkdir nowayos && cd nowayos
-git clone https://github.com/NoWayOS/nowayos.git nowayos
+mkdir nowayos-work && cd nowayos-work
+git clone https://github.com/NoWayOS/nowayos.git
 git clone https://github.com/NoWayOS/screen-compiler.git screen-compiler
-make -C nowayos container                    # build the pinned dev image once (it takes a while)
+make -C nowayos container                    # build the pinned dev image once (about 4 minutes)
 cd screen-compiler
 make test                                    # unit, property, snapshot and CLI tests
 make run ARGS="check fixtures/welcome.tsx"   # check one screen against the subset
